SUMMARY:Shamanic Shakti Activation Ceremony with Osama Khan
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nExperience a safe and lovingly held group
  energetic transmission that will help you to activate your life force ene
 rgy\, release energetic blocks\, and come into alignment with your highest
  calling. These ceremonies are guided and supported by the Light of Christ
 \, enlightened Saint Neem Karoli Baba\, The “Tree of Light” Noya Rao\,
  and the Pleiadians\, Arcturians and Lyrans. There is nothing to do but su
 rrender\, allow and receive the grace of the divine universal life force e
 nergy that permeates the cosmos.\n\nParticipants are advised to arrive wit
 h a light/empty stomach (last large meal 2 hours prior or smaller meal 1 h
 our prior—do not arrive starving). Mats and blankets are available but f
 eel free to bring your own if preferred. Please contact Osama at 714-743-5
 677 to RSVP or ask questions.\n\nDonations welcome.
