SUMMARY:Astrology Workshop: Breaking Free With Uranus with Senseful Wellne
 ss
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n**Breaking Free With Uranus**\nUranus is 
 changing from Taurus/Gemini!\n\nJoin us in a discussion on Uranus Taurus T
 ransit and what's to come with Uranus Gemini. We’ll share the importance
  of Uranus in astrology and cover your personal sign/house to give a more 
 personal understanding of how you relate to this energy individually and g
 enerationally.\n\nNote: Bring your chart if you have it or we can help whe
 n you arrive. Birth times are not required but always encouraged for more 
 accuracy.\n\n* Jenn has been a practicing Astrologer for 7+ years and offe
 rs Astrology readings live @energeticexperiences select days ( see monthly
  calendar)\n\n*Donation Only Event $*\nPersonal Readings Available at: [se
 nsefulwellness.com](http://sensefulwellness.com/)
